5. Use Case

Class:
App\Services\Product\UpdateProduct

Responsibilities:
- Inject Interfaces
- Update product via repository
- Apply business rules
- Return product id, name, active

Flow:
1. Call App\Repository\Contracts\ProductInterface findById($id) AS $product
2. If not found:
	- Throw ResourceNotFoundException
3. Call App\Repository\Contracts\ProductTypeInterface findProductTypeById($product_type_id) AS $productType
4. If not found:
	- Throw ResourceNotFoundException
5. Call App\Repository\Contracts\ProductInterface findProductBySku($sku) 
	- If found AND id != current product id:
		- Throw BusinessRuleException
6. Call App\Services\ProductType\Rules\ProductTypeMustNotBeDeleted validate($productType)
7. Call App\Services\Product\Rules\AvailableAtFutureOrTodayRule validate($available_at)
8. Call App\Services\ProductType\Rules\ProductTypeNeedAParentRule validate($productType)
9. Call ProductInterface $repository updateProduct(int $id, array $request)

10. Return updated product (id, name, active)

